# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
# Written inactive:
#   shop/web-calico/ingress-4: every service but some: a service object of ZLD lists what it matches
#   shop/web-calico/ingress-5: not converted: an HTTP match (application layer policy)
#   payments/api-ingress/ingress-1-2: service sctp-3868: source ports, an ICMP code, SCTP ports or protocol 0, which a service object cannot say
#   payments/api-ingress/ingress-3: not converted: protocol 'ICMP' (TCP, UDP or SCTP)
